        "title": "The diagram below shows a small local museum and its surroundings in 1957 and 2007. Summarize the information and make comparisons where relevant.",
        "status": "draft",
        "content_writing": "<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>The diagram below shows a small local museum and its surroundings in 1957 and 2007. </strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Summarize the information and make comparisons where relevant.</strong></span></div>",
        "order": 1,
        "instruction": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">HƯỚNG DẪN VIẾT B&Agrave;I</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><em>IELTS Writing Task 1 - Local Museum and Surroundings: 1957 vs 2007</em></p>\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UQlGdpAaUoJFOsxWOYzlDAiUgDe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>1.</strong><strong> </strong><strong>Giải th&iacute;ch đề</strong></span></h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N0nNdqrxtoU9EGxkGvml6QHzgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GWPNd7ft0oPRpuxfDGnl1aKWgoe\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">Đề b&agrave;i Local Museum and Surroundings: 1957 vs 2007 y&ecirc;u cầu m&ocirc; tả về bản vẽ ph&ograve;ng sinh hoạt chung của &nbsp;sự thay đổi của museum qua 50 năm.</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QxWPdDnfdod2NixZJAjlLYzqgGb\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTLqda2f9ooxOTxsgKLlEoHXgHc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>2.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Introduction</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DQntd3hjzoNCjwxOfz4lvHOcgbb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N9LhdhEVXoJnGNxJPvyl0YZPg9e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CRT6dLvfRoVbHtxCnc9l7AdygTl\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\" old-record-id-KGfkdvXnMo9tBVxWubvlf0gagVh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TOoQd6oJTo25Hhxi84tlE4FPgnb\"><strong>Nội dung:</strong> Paraphrase đề Local Museum and Surroundings: 1957 vs 2007 với c&aacute;c dữ kiện ch&iacute;nh l&agrave;: những sự thay đổi của một bảo t&agrave;ng địa phương nhỏ v&agrave; khu vực xung quanh - so s&aacute;nh sự thay đổi của bảo t&agrave;ng trong suốt 50 năm.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-J4uYdJ7WaomtjrxzeNDl41h0g1n\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>3.</strong><strong> Định hướng viết Overview</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U7iadbsa0o9CMOxYDBClUkAhgse\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework <sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề map, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ tập trung n&oacute;i về c&aacute;c sự thay đổi ch&iacute;nh của Local Museum and Surroundings: 1957 vs 2007:\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NZdNdn58xo1DePxzr3CldmTZgch\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>bảo t&agrave;ng <strong>đ&atilde; trải qua sự mở rộng v&agrave; hiện đại h&oacute;a đ&aacute;ng kể</strong> <em>(underwent significant expansion and modernization)</em> trong khoảng thời gian n&agrave;y, chuyển đổi từ <strong>một cấu tr&uacute;c đơn giản chỉ c&oacute; một t&ograve;a nh&agrave; </strong><em>(a simple single-building structure)</em> th&agrave;nh một khu phức hợp lớn hơn nhiều với <strong>nhiều cơ sở chuy&ecirc;n biệt</strong> <em>(multiple specialized facilities)</em>.</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YrsZdcaVdo9kuExrx6GlVa8Ogce\" data-list=\"bullet\">một b&atilde;i đậu xe đ&atilde; được x&acirc;y dựng để <strong>phục vụ du kh&aacute;ch</strong> <em>(accommodate visitors)</em>, trong khi khu vườn được bảo tồn.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup> &copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c chi tiết dựa tr&ecirc;n ti&ecirc;u ch&iacute; về <strong>những thay đổi đ&atilde; xảy ra b&ecirc;n trong v&agrave; b&ecirc;n ngo&agrave;i bảo t&agrave;ng</strong>:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FKLxd8T0jomlW3xlEQ5lfJGxgwb\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong>&nbsp;Sự thay đổi b&ecirc;n trong museum (The internal changes to the museum)</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xz8Sd3833oJVsmxgnsUlprJUgUb\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup> &copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NyZkdJIdqordWLxHdWolzvIygLh\" data-list=\"bullet\">X&eacute;t về những thay đổi b&ecirc;n trong bảo t&agrave;ng, năm 1957, t&ograve;a nh&agrave; chỉ c&oacute; ba khu vực ch&iacute;nh: một triển l&atilde;m lịch sử quốc gia ở trung t&acirc;m, hai b&ecirc;n l&agrave; ph&ograve;ng lịch sử địa phương b&ecirc;n tr&aacute;i v&agrave; ph&ograve;ng kho bảo t&agrave;ng b&ecirc;n phải, với <strong>một sảnh lối v&agrave;o trung t&acirc;m cung cấp lối ra v&agrave;o</strong> <em>(a central entrance hall providing access)</em>.&nbsp;</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NyZkdJIdqordWLxHdWolzvIygLh\" data-list=\"bullet\">Đến năm 2007, bảo t&agrave;ng đ&atilde; được thiết kế lại ho&agrave;n to&agrave;n với <strong>bố cục tinh vi hơn</strong> <em>(a more sophisticated layout)</em>, bao gồm c&aacute;c khu vực chuy&ecirc;n biệt như triển l&atilde;m đặc biệt v&agrave; trung t&acirc;m gi&aacute;o dục <strong>ở phần tr&ecirc;n</strong> <em>(in the upper section)</em>, ph&ograve;ng lịch sử địa phương ở trung t&acirc;m, v&agrave; ph&ograve;ng bảo t&agrave;ng, khu vực lễ t&acirc;n, v&agrave; qu&aacute;n c&agrave; ph&ecirc; được bố tr&iacute; ở phần dưới của t&ograve;a nh&agrave;.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<br>\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P28wdkqCxoxJzCxhGfIlLa1cgwd\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">BODY </span><strong>2:</strong><strong> Sự thay đổi diễn ra b&ecirc;n ngo&agrave;i museum (the external modifications)</strong></span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EwzTddSWRoqDSGxM4hFlvPg1grc\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OrA9dgGjNoRCVUxfgJ1lOWFlglh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework <sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:\n<div data-page-id=\"WC9GdWptxodM3rxqUu4lYwk6gDd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QyQodgEOhoXShpx5DiHlySGigNK\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">bảo t&agrave;ng năm 1957 được bao quanh bởi vườn <strong>ở ph&iacute;a bắc </strong><em>(on the north side)</em> v&agrave; c&oacute; lối ra v&agrave;o trực tiếp từ đường ch&iacute;nh qua một lối đi đơn giản.</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-HXWndmoYhoJyvLxXdlblkp71gJg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">Năm mươi năm sau, trong khi khu vườn ph&iacute;a bắc<strong> được giữ lại </strong><em>(was retained)</em>, <strong>việc tiếp cận bảo t&agrave;ng</strong> <em>(the museum's accessibility)</em> đ&atilde; được cải thiện đ&aacute;ng kể với việc bổ sung một b&atilde;i đậu xe chuy&ecirc;n dụng nằm ở ph&iacute;a nam của t&ograve;a nh&agrave;, v&agrave; một hệ thống lối v&agrave;o mới được thiết lập để quản l&yacute; d&ograve;ng du kh&aacute;ch tốt hơn.</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 2020,
            "sort": 1,
            "name": "Introduction",
            "value": "<p>The maps illustrate the layout of a local museum and its surrounding area in 1957 and 2007, showing the developments that took place over a 50-year period.</p>",
            "question_id": 18749,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2021,
            "sort": 2,
            "name": "Overview",
            "value": "<p>Overall, the museum underwent significant expansion and modernization during this timeframe, transforming from a simple single-building structure into a much larger complex with multiple specialized facilities. Additionally, a car park was constructed to accommodate visitors, while the garden area was preserved.</p>",
            "question_id": 18749,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2022,
            "sort": 3,
            "name": "Body 1",
            "value": "<p>Looking at the internal changes to the museum, in 1957, the building housed only three main areas: a national history exhibition at the center, flanked by a local history room on the left and a museum store room on the right, with a central entrance hall providing access. By 2007, the museum had been completely redesigned with a more sophisticated layout, featuring specialized areas including special exhibitions and an education centre in the upper section, a local history room in the center, and a museum room, reception area, and caf&eacute; strategically positioned in the lower part of the building.</p>",
            "question_id": 18749,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          },
          {
            "id": 2023,
            "sort": 4,
            "name": "Body 2",
            "value": "<p>Regarding the external modifications, the 1957 museum was surrounded by gardens on the north side and had direct access from the main road via a simple path. Fifty years later, while the garden area to the north was retained, the museum's accessibility was greatly improved with the addition of a dedicated car park located to the south of the building, and a new entrance system was established to better manage visitor flow.</p>",
            "question_id": 18749,
            "is_toggle_on": true
          }
        ],
